{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2035b2a7-d9e3-885c-96c0-320d070b5e88",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:58:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Um. [pause] My name is Peggy Brennan. I'm calling about a tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a tree. Take your time. Where's the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It came down. [pause] The whole thing. Across the side street. Near my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Is this from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The nor'easter. [pause] Friday and Saturday. Two days ago now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that was a rough one. And what's the address, or the closest one to the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 464 Bliss Road. [pause] The tree is on the little side street next to us. Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "464 Bliss Road, side street next to it. Okay, writing that down. Is the tree blocking the whole road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Across it. [pause] Cars can't get by. I looked this morning. [line breaks up] it's just laying there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a little on that last part. Did you say any wires are on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. [pause] I didn't go close. I'm not sure. That's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart, don't go near it. If you see a wire down or touching the branches, treat it as live and stay back. Can you see from your window whether anything's hanging off the poles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires on the ground. [pause] I can see the top of it. Just branches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'll put that in the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask something? [pause] Who do I call? For a tree. Is it the city? Or the owner? Or the electric company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question, and it trips up a lot of people. If it's in the public road or on city land, we handle it. If it came off private property, the owner is usually responsible for the tree itself, though the city can clear the road part. And if wires are involved, that's the utility. You've called the right place to start, and I'll send it over to the crew so they can look at where it came from."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. [pause] I need it moved soon. My daughter just started driving lessons. We practice on that street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, nice, a good quiet street for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] I get nervous in the car with her. [pause] I don't want her coming around the corner and finding that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:57:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. I'd keep her off that block until it's cleared. Let me get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:57:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:57:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172. Got it. So that's a whole tree across the side street by 464 Bliss Road, no wires seen, from the weekend storm. I'll mark it as blocking the road so it gets looked at quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:58:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. [pause] I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:58:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Peggy. Stay warm, and call back if anything changes, especially if you see a wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
